---
import PageHeader from "../../../ui/components/PageHeader.astro";
import DecisionStateCard from "../../../ui/components/feedback/DecisionStateCard.astro";
// RT-NCR-002. This page exists so the declared create route never falls through
// to the NCR detail route (`/quality/ncr/[ncrId]`), which previously rendered a
// detail view for the literal id `new` (QC-100-FINAL-016 P2-4).
//
// Direct NCR creation stays gated by PD-15/PD-16. The surface reports that
// server state; it does not implement an eligibility rule that has no source.
import AppLayout from '../../../ui/layouts/AppLayout.astro';
const actor = Astro.locals.actor;
if (!actor) return Astro.redirect('/login?returnTo=%2Fquality%2Fncr%2Fnew');
---
<AppLayout title="New NCR · Quality" locale="en" direction="ltr">
  <PageHeader section="Quality">
    <Fragment slot="heading"><h1>New NCR</h1></Fragment>
    <p class="lede">Create an NCR from a finding or inspection.</p>
  </PageHeader>
  <DecisionStateCard
    heading="Direct creation is not available."
    decisionId="PD-15 · PD-16"
    owner="QC owner; QC / inspection procedure owner"
    decisionNote="Finding-to-NCR criteria and inspection FAIL handling are not in force. No eligibility rule or record number is inferred."
    actions={[
      { href: '/quality/ncr', label: 'Open the NCR register' },
      { href: '/quality/findings', label: 'Open findings' },
    ]}
  >
    <p>This page does not provide the authorized NCR creation flow. Creating an NCR requires an authorized finding relationship and the NCR-create permission. Nothing was changed.</p>
    <p class="state-card__muted">Existing NCR records stay available in the register. The original source content and recorded state are not modified by this page.</p>
  </DecisionStateCard>
</AppLayout>
<style>
  .lede { margin: var(--space-2) 0 0; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: var(--font-size-md); }
</style>
